This project implements the semantics and paradigms of the following
open-source protocols. No source code from these projects is copied;
only their conceptual interfaces are implemented from scratch.

Model Context Protocol (MCP)
  Copyright (c) Anthropic, PBC
  Licensed under the MIT License
  https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/specification

